Last Friday, I visited our flagship campus Helios in West Texas. Three years ago, this was still a bitcoin mining facility. Today Helios is a fully operational AI-ready campus with 133MW of critical IT capacity, and we’re just getting started!

@galaxyhq is taking a big swing out here, and so is America. The move to build an AI future for this country is real, and none of it happens without the physical infrastructure. It starts with power, land, and hard-working people willing to put in the work to build a new future.

Our partnership with @TechAthletics with Galaxy Stadium is part of investing in the local community and workforce pipeline right here in Texas. Guns up!!

